    {
        "text": "Ashen skies. Strong winds. Untamed wilds. Somber graves."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the final resting place for all High Inquisitors."
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "Irene still remembers the sight, from the first time her master brought her here."
    },
    {
        "text": "What she dared not tell him at the time was that it had made her heart burn with a zealous sense of purpose. That to her, their sacrifice was something to be glorified."
    },
    {
        "text": "That she had felt as if the entire graveyard was shrouded in a hallowed beauty."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g26_dusk_wild",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
