        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's so beautiful...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "Irene.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! Y-Yes, Maestro!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as you've chosen to become my deputy, then starting today, I am not just your teacher, but also your superior officer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is where my mentor brought me when I first became an Inquisitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most of the graves here are cenotaphs. After all, not many in our line of work are recovered in one piece when we die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "So rather than their bodies, their lanterns and weapons better represent the trail they've cleared in life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "As such, we place them here on the graves of every Inquisitor to fall in battle, to serve as a memorial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "And these nine tombstones... are for the nine Saints.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nine? But isn't your master, Lord Carmen, still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "While the other eight have long since perished on their journey, Lord Carmen has already designated this as his final resting place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "(How wonderful would it be if I could give my life defending Iberia and be buried here too.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Irene.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "One day, you will also bring my lantern and weapon here, to lay them to rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 50,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I can only hope that when that day comes, you will not grieve, but rather have understood what we fight for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because by then, nobody will be left to instruct you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until that day, though, I will teach you everything I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Inquisitor Dario"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "Irene remembers answering with a resounding 'Yes, sir!'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at the time, she did not understand the weight of her master's words, nor the weight of a life."
    },
    {
        "text": "She did not understand. Not until after everything she experienced on the Stultifera, not until she was carrying her master's tools with her to lay upon his grave."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are more graves here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Irene arrives in front of one."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Here sleeps High Inquisitor Dario.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "A simple wooden plaque. A single, unassuming sentence, with no embellishments. The grave of a High Inquisitor."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lest she disturb his soul, she gingerly places what he left behind on his grave, before slowly sitting down."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maestro, I've brought your lantern. I've brought your weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you requested, I've returned them to your grave, so that your soul may return to your homeland.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "But, even though I made that promise back then, I never thought the day would come so soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "While it's been some time since it happened, I still can't believe that you're no longer with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, you're gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "There will be nobody to scold me for being childish. Nobody to warn me to think more, to observe more. Nobody to shelter me from the wind and the rain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...Never mind. If you could hear me now, I'm sure you'd just chide me for being soft and weak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. I still remember what you said. That you hoped I would understand what we are fighting for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I do now. At least somewhat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... I might not be back to visit you for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Not because I've lost faith in my beliefs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "If anything, I'm doing this because I now truly understand the meaning of 'inquisition.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you can continue to watch over me, Maestro.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor Irene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
