    },
    {
        "text": "See, Kal'tsit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saint Carmen"
    },
    {
        "text": "For me, the opportunity for \u00c6gir and Iberia to rejoin hands came far, far too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saint Carmen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if they've given us an opportunity to turn things around, time has taken its toll on me, and I can no longer feel even the slightest bit of joy from it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saint Carmen"
    },
    {
        "text": "But for her, it truly is the dawn of a new day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saint Carmen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If their evolution is the instinct of life itself, then the decision she made just now must surely be the instinct of civilization.",
